4. After apply, confirm that the Bitrise app is connected to the expected application repository and template version.
5. Have the platform owner confirm source events, webhook access, branch rules, and required build statuses.

**Expected result:** you can identify the Bitrise app, app source branch, source revision, template ID, and template version.

