| Operation | Implementation in the supplied setup | What to inspect |
| --- | --- | --- |
| App registration | `bitrise-step-saucelabs-app-create` | Request metadata belongs to your app. |
| Binary upload | `saucelabs-bitrise-step` | Built file exists and its filename matches configuration. |
| Resolve uploaded file | `scripts/resolve-sauce-app.sh` or `.js` | Exact uploaded storage identity. |
